00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:32.650
The Kuu-samas are all saying 
the same thing over and over.

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:34.300
They just want to become one.

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:36.570
If they get rid of people who ruin

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:40.470
or can't read the atmosphere, 
they can all become one.

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:41.760
That fits their logic.

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:44.620
So that's why the people 
who were iffy around them

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:46.640
