00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:50.380
Now that we know that, the more we 
can't leave the Kuu-samas alone!

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:52.380
The fact that they're 
attacking people for the sake

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:54.030
