00:09:55.550 --> 00:09:58.110
Is the atmosphere such a bad thing?

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:01.900
I had just been going with 
the flow for a while now.

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:04.080
Well, I mean, I just realized it now.

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:07.330
People were treating me really great 
just because I was a Gatchaman.

00:10:07.930 --> 00:10:09.920
All these girls started approaching me,

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:12.040
and I even went to karaoke, which I hate.

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:15.690
Eating barbecue that definitely 
wasn't very good...

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:18.990
And yet, that was all a lot of fun.

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:25.930
Isn't it amazing to be able 
to have fun without thinking?

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:29.910
It should be fine to find happiness 
just going along with the flow of things.

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:31.020
Yeah...

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:34.830
When you're surrounded by the atmosphere, 
you feel warm and relaxed.

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:37.990
But what happens when you go outside of it?

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:45.980
Hey, stop. This is going too far.

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:48.350
The Gatchaman are our enemies!

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:50.300
You're okay with just leaving them alone?

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:52.950
Yeah, but you don't have to go this far.

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:53.620
Right?

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:55.800
Raiding their place is a bit...

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:58.140
