00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:17.020
To this country where

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:19.980
everyone is so easily swayed!

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:21.110
I see.

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:24.150
But I can't allow myself to be defeated.

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:25.610
Because...

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:27.510
I haven't made everyone become one yet!

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:36.250
So my child's work is being 
displayed at that exhibit.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:39.750
Would you all like to come 
with me to see it this Sunday?

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.910
Yes, let's go.

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:43.630
You'll come, too, right, Sasaki-san?

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:47.880
I'm sorry. I have plans to go 
out with my family that day.

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:49.780
Don't be like that.

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:51.600
We're all friends, aren't we?

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:54.660
Th-Then I guess I'll go.

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:56.060
Right?

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:04.050
It might feel nice when you're 
surrounded by the atmosphere.

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:05.030
But...

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:07.990
Once people go too far trying to become one,

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:11.090
they silently put pressure on those 
who try to leave that atmosphere.

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:16.040
If that happens, people can't 
think or move on their own.

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:19.610
People are happier when they're all one.

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:21.210
Why don't you understand, Jou-san?

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:24.070
Even if people are momentarily happy,

00:14:24.070 --> 00:14:27.220
society will fail to grow!

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:30.680
<b>English Reading Comprehension</b>

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:30.680
<b>Concentration Training 
 English Grammar and Vocabulary</b>

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:30.680
What do you want to do?

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:32.610
Hey, want to go to karaoke?

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:33.640
Yeah, totally!

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:37.430
Let's become one.

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:40.060
It's a lot more fun singing 
with everyone else.

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:43.620
I guess... I'll go, too.

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:44.680
Right?

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:45.860
Right?

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:59.210
Phoenix Dive!

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:01.920
Innocent Storm!

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:12.220
Innocent...

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:20.480
...Tornado.

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:50.520
Are you okay?

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:53.030
You're not alone.

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:54.350
No...

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:55.590
Stay back!

00:15:55.590 --> 00:15:57.760
Don't be like that.

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:59.270
Let's become one.

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:00.310
No!

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.450
You're gonna catch a cold.

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:24.890
I...

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:27.950
I don't know anymore.

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:31.860
I just wanted to make a peaceful 
world where no one gets hurt.

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:35.600
You probably just kept running.

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:36.350
Eh?

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:38.390
That's just how you are, Tsubasa-chan,

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:40.810
but right now might be a good time to stop.

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:43.890
But what should I do once I stop?

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:48.650
Hmm... Well, I think you should ask Yuru-jii.

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:50.190
Yuru-jii...

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:54.280
All right. I'll go home to Nagaoka.

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:57.000
Thank you for everything, Senpai.

00:16:57.580 --> 00:16:58.720
I'll be waiting for you.

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:02.500
You're probably the only one 
who can save Gel-chan.

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:03.000
Eh?

00:17:05.010 --> 00:17:09.310
I wonder what heroes are. 
Heroes are, heroes are.

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:13.480
I wonder what heroes are. 
Heroes are, heroes are.

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:16.590
I wonder what heroes are. Heroes are...

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:21.600
I guess it can't be helped 
if we can't become one.

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:24.980
Wind Shield!

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:28.730
Sugane! Why did you come?

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:32.280
I told you I'd settle things with him alone.

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:35.530
I took a moment to think...

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:36.950
And then, I just felt

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:39.160
that I needed to go to you, Jou-san.

00:17:45.300 --> 00:17:46.490
Sugane!

00:17:47.350 --> 00:17:50.750
Maybe I couldn't read the atmosphere...

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:52.380
You idiot...

00:17:56.730 --> 00:17:58.010
Tsubasa-chan...

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:08.940
Well, this is a surprise.

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:10.980
I heard I had a visitor, but...

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:17.240
<b>From X to Rizumu-san:</b>

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:17.240
Suzuki Rizumu, would you consider 
talking to Rui for a moment?

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:18.670
Why me?

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:20.930
I thought of this as Rui's friend...

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:23.960
About what he needed most right now...

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:26.900
And you are probably the last person

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:28.980
Rui would want to be 
seen with in his current state.

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:36.770
<i>Well, you've become quite the fool.</i>

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:40.340
Hey, it's Suzuki Rizumu.

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:43.090
<i>How does it feel to become an ape?</i>

00:18:43.090 --> 00:18:45.600
It feels really nice.

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:49.040
I wonder why I tried so hard 
to do things on my own.

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:53.360
It's such a wonderful thing 
to become one with others.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:55.560
<i>I see. Congratulations.</i>

00:18:56.070 --> 00:19:00.630
<i>Apparently, Ninomiya Rui's update ends here.</i>

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:03.990
<i>You've become a boring person.</i>

00:19:13.780 --> 00:19:16.440
Utsutsu's gone to Sugane-kun's place.

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:18.880
Though I'm sure he won't 
be able to move immediately.

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:21.340
But he should be okay.

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:25.140
Curse that Gelsadra! 
We have to crush him!

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:27.020
I wonder if we can.

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:30.070
Despite how he looks, 
Gel-chan's a tough opponent.

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:33.020
Is that JJ-sama?!

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:42.780
When the scarlet conductor 
changes his melody, 
the people will lose their own colors, 
and bear their fangs in err 
at the colorless wind.

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:38.560
<i>When the scarlet conductor 
changes his melody,</i>

00:19:38.560 --> 00:19:41.230
<i>the people will lose their own colors,</i>

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:45.460
<i>and bear their fangs in err 
at the colorless wind.</i>

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:48.070
I don't understand!

00:19:48.070 --> 00:19:52.200
JJ-sama! Please make it simpler!

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.750
This is the same as usual.

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:00.630
<b>Bicycle Parking 
Entrance</b>

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:00.630
<b>Tachikawa Preschool</b>

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:05.080
Mana-chan, let's play with the ball.

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:06.530
Everyone's doing it.

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:08.520
No. I wanna draw.

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:10.770
Let's all play together.

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:13.160
Come on. Everyone's waiting.

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:17.060
Papa?

00:20:17.060 --> 00:20:18.280
We're going home, Mana.

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:21.950
Mana.

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:27.330
Why do we have to hide?

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:28.410
Shh. Let's go.

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:35.040
Man, that's what he gets 
for calling Gatchaman heroes.

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:37.450
What an idiot. 
He should read the atmosphere.

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:40.800
Yoshida-kun... No...

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:44.220
That was so annoying.

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:46.610
Let's become one.

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:51.770
R-Right... H-He totally deserved what he got.

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:57.190
Liar!

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:02.280
Mana!

00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:12.050
They probably didn't think 
that one of the security guards

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:13.460
was a member of VAPE.

00:21:14.020 --> 00:21:16.970
But, Leader, why now?

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:19.250
I changed my mind.

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:24.260
I thought I should change the atmosphere.

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:28.730
I got it!

00:21:28.730 --> 00:21:31.960
What? Do you understand 
the prophecy? Tell me!

00:21:31.960 --> 00:21:34.430
We'll talk later! We have to hurry!

00:21:34.430 --> 00:21:35.770
Hurry? Where?

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:38.520
We have to go protect Gel-chan!

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:40.270
<b>Our Hearts As One!  
Create Our World Together!</b>

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:41.230
<b>Echigo-Yuzawa</b>
